     0% 2.5% 25% 50% 75% 97.5% 100%
[1,]  0    0   0   0   0     0    0

t0 = Original statistic computed from data
t_B = Vector of bootstrap samples

so, I think the problem lies in the parboot function?

Thanks again for taking the time to help!

Katie

