MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The easiest way is probably to use summary(), which in addition to printing them also returns a data frame of these stats:

s <- summary(out_test)

s$state[,4] # p value

Ken

